# KonSol 0.6 / TEST-08 multi-label traffic-state demo
KAP2

CLS BLACK
TEXT 16 18 3 CYAN "MULTI LABEL"
TEXT 16 48 2 WHITE "TOUCH 3X"
SERIAL "MULTILABEL KAP2"

MOVI R0 0
LABEL LOOP

WAIT_TOUCH
INC R0
CMPI R0 1
JZ RED_STATE
CMPI R0 2
JZ YELLOW_STATE
JMP GREEN_STATE

LABEL RED_STATE
CLS BLACK
TEXT 48 70 4 RED "RED"
TEXT 24 118 2 WHITE "STEP"
DRAW_REG 96 118 2 RED R0
TEXT 24 160 2 YELLOW "TOUCH NEXT"
JMP LOOP

LABEL YELLOW_STATE
CLS BLACK
TEXT 24 70 4 YELLOW "YELLOW"
TEXT 24 118 2 WHITE "STEP"
DRAW_REG 96 118 2 YELLOW R0
TEXT 24 160 2 YELLOW "TOUCH NEXT"
JMP LOOP

LABEL GREEN_STATE
CLS BLACK
TEXT 36 70 4 GREEN "GREEN"
TEXT 24 118 2 WHITE "STEP"
DRAW_REG 96 118 2 GREEN R0
TEXT 24 160 2 YELLOW "TOUCH TO EXIT"
WAIT_TOUCH
EXIT
